SUMMARY:GTApreneurs May 13-2026 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking Even
 t Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*You n
 eed to register on our website to attend this event and get the link. RSVP
 ing on Meetup does not mean that you are registered\, even though Meetup.c
 om will send you an email saying that you have. Thank you. Please go here:
  https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-toronto\n\n\\*Please note this 
 event is advertised on multiple platforms\, and we expect around 20-25 gue
 sts.\n\nDo you want more clients? Join us for GTApreneurs May 13-2026 Afte
 rnoon Virtual Business Networking Event to connect with other amazing entr
 epreneurs\, learn something new and promote your business!\n\nThis event w
 ill feature Guest Speaker\, **Jaspreet Chager**\, Owner of Chager.org. Jas
 preet is an AI strategist and co-author of The AI Revolution who helps bus
 iness owners use AI tools to save time\, win clients\, and build real solu
 tions — no tech background required.\n\nCONTACT **Jaspreet** at jchagerp
 s@gmail.com and visit www.chager.org\n\n**WARM-UP ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:
 45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n* **12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welco
 ming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm:** Featured Presentation: Jaspreet Ch
 ager\, ***“Build It Live: What AI Can Actually Do for Your Business Righ
 t Now“***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\nFree\
 n\n**PREMIUM EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking
 ]**\n* **12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12
 :30pm:** Featured Presentation: Jaspreet Chager\, ***“Build It Live: Wha
 t AI Can Actually Do for Your Business Right Now“***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:*
 * Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\n* **1:00-2:00pm:** Breakout rooms (N
 etwork 1-1 with other guests)\n\n**TICKETS**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Grou
 p\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n**Non-members:** $10\n\
 \*Premium ticket includes Guest Contact sheet emailed to you after the eve
 nt. Note: You must attend the event to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\
 n**Event Organizer & Host:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** President and Business Coa
 ch\, GTApreneurs\nVisit https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gtaprene
 urs.com/business-coaching-toronto for more information about Tammy and her
  Business Coaching and Consulting services.\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT
 ?**\nContact Tammy at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com or book a vid
 eo consultation with her here: https://calendly.com/gtapreneurs
