SUMMARY:GTApreneurs May 26-2026 Business Networking Event Vaughan - Toront
 o
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  an exciting Business Networking Event in Vaughan\, just north of Toronto 
 on Tuesday May 26\, 2026 where you can meet potential clients and referral
  partners\, learn something new\, enjoy a meal and promote your business!\
 n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-vaughan\n\
 nThis event will feature Guest Speaker **Karen Goslin**\, Psychotherapist\
 , Clinical Consultant\, Mentor\, Author\, KG&Associates. Karen is a Canadi
 an registered psychotherapist with over 30 years’ experience and creator
  of the KG Accountable Therapy™ Method\, an approach driving sustainable
  change. A University of Toronto MSW graduate\, award-winning author of Ye
 llow Paint (2025)\, and international speaker\, she helps audiences move b
 eyond insight to meaningful\, accountable growth.\n\nContact **Karen** at 
 karenrsw@yahoo.ca or (647) 985-0633 and visit https://karenrsw.com to lear
 n more about her services.\n\n**VENUE:** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor audito
 rium\n**ADDRESS:** 7250 Keele St\, Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. an
 d 407)\n\n**PARKING:** Free\, onsite. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the buildi
 ng off of Snidercroft Rd\n\n**\\*\\*DIRECTIONS TO FIND THE ROOM:** Walk th
 rough entrance M\, go straight ahead until you get to the main aisle. Stra
 ight ahead will be a staircase. If you prefer to take the elevator\, make 
 a right at the main aisle\, go down a few stores and you will see it on th
 e left.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, fo
 od buffet\, visit exhibitor booths\n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcomi
 ng presentation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:** Guest Speaker Presentation: Karen Gosl
 in\, ***"The Inner CEO: Mastering the Mindset That Drives Entrepreneurial 
 Success"***\n* **6:30-7:00pm:** Exhibitor Introductions + member Elevator 
 Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** Open networking\, visit exhibitor booths\n\n**
 MENU:** Pizza\, Veggies\, Fruit\, dessert and other snacks\n**BEVERAGES:**
  Pop and water\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibit
 or and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $29 in advance 
 / $30 on event day\n\n***Not a GTApreneurs Member?*** Go here to view our 
 memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memb
 erships\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\n\nCall or text Tammy at (416) 5
 22-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com.\n\nTo learn about Tammy Defoe's business 
 coaching services\, please go to https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https:/
 /gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto\n\n**EXHIBITORS:**\n\n* **Goret
 te Marques\,** Global Bricks Realty\, https://gmarquesrealtor.com\n* **Son
 ia Kurmey\,** Arbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n* **Balbir Pabila\,**
  PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com\n* **Abhi
 shek Basak\,** Clerk Tech\, www.clerk-tech.com\n* **Monica Hecht\,** The V
 illage Hive\, www.thevillagehive.ca\n* **Jaspreet Chager\,** Chager.org\, 
 www.chager.org\n\n\\*Exhibitor tables available. Visit www.gtapreneurs.com
 /exhibitor to book a spot\n\n\\*We will EMAIL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET 
 the day after the event by 5pm. If you don't receive it in your inbox\, pl
 ease check your SPAM/JUNK folder. Note: You must attend the event to recei
 ve the guest contact sheet.
