SUMMARY:GTApreneurs June 3-2026 Downtown Toronto Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  a vibrant Business Networking Event in Toronto where you may meet your ne
 xt client or referral partner. Discover opportunities and connect! Registe
 r now.\n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-tor
 onto\n\n**VENUE:** The Village Hive Eglinton\n**ADDRESS:** 120 Eglinton Av
 e E\, 3rd floor event space\, Toronto\, ON\n**TRANSIT:** Get off at Eglint
 on subway station\, walk East down Eglinton a few minutes and you will fin
 d it on the north side of the street in a tall office building\n**PARKING:
 ** Parking garage in Loblaws building (entrance on Lilian Street)\n\n**ITI
 NERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking\n* **7:00-7:05pm:** GTApre
 neurs’ presentation\n* **7:05-7:15pm:** Venue Host presentation: Serene 
 Chin\, **“The Power of Community in Entrepreneurship”**\n* **7:15-8:00
 pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Appetizers and beverages provided.\n\n**TICKET
 S:**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Member
 s:** Free\n**Non-members:** $20\n***\\*Includes a Guest Contact Sheet*** e
 mailed to you the day after the event. Note: You need to attend the event 
 to receive the sheet.\n\n**HOSTS:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** President of GTApre
 neurs\nLearn more about Tammy’s Coaching services at www.gtapreneurs.com
 /business-coaching-toronto\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?** Call 416-522-
 7770 or email info@gtapreneurs.com\n\nand\n\n**Serene Chin**\, Community M
 anager at The Village Hive Eglinton.\n\nSerene is the friendly and dedicat
 ed Community Manager at The Village Hive’s Eglinton location in midtown 
 Toronto. Serene brings a wealth of experience as an entrepreneur and mortg
 age broker\, along with a passion for community. She founded one of the GT
 A’s first dog cake bakeries\, blending her love for dogs with her entrep
 reneurial spirit. An active community leader with the Leitchcroft Communit
 y Association\, Serene is always focused on building connections and suppo
 rting local businesses. Fluent in four languages and a volunteer with the 
 Markham Dog Alliance\, she brings warmth\, enthusiasm\, and a true connect
 or’s spirit to The Hive.\n\n**CONTACT SERENE:**\n\\(647\\) 500\\-0980 \\
 | [www.thevillagehive.ca/eglinton](www.thevillagehive.ca/eglinton) \\| inf
 o@eglintonhive\\.ca\n\nView all of GTApreneurs events and services at www.
 gtapreneurs.com\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
